 "about": "Mui (喵), omui's figure: pixel art whose every pixel is a vector square, drawn by the framework (the site plan §8.2). A frame is rows of cells, one letter a cell: '.' nothing, o outline, b body, s body in shade, l body in light, w white, p pupil, k blush. A palette names each letter's colour. Chosen (A2, 2026-11-08): a head of 16 and a body of 24; indigo and night, and the agent's (its eyes lit cyan) for when a visitor's agent drives it. The body's frames are the states of the site plan §9.1: sit and blink (quiet), look (attention), point (guide), hold (needs you to confirm), sleep, walk and walk2 (moving).",
